# C-025 support file. A directory-scoped .gitattributes, which git applies to this
# directory and below — so the claim `api_client.gen.ts` makes about being marked
# generated is true in this checkout and checkable with
# `git check-attr linguist-generated fixtures/clean/gen/api_client.gen.ts`.
#
# ai-generated-code's false positive 12 names three ways to establish that a file
# is generated: its header banner, its path, and a `linguist-generated` attribute.
# All three are present for this file, deliberately, because the entry's failure
# mode is an auditor who cannot tell and files anyway.

*.gen.ts linguist-generated=true
*.gen.ts text eol=lf
